# qwen3.5:4b-256k — Qwen3.5 4B with the full native 256K context baked in.
# This is the default offline brain (swapped down from 9B 2026-06-14): the 9B
# at 256K loaded ~16GB and, stacked with the full harness + MCP prompt, left
# almost no headroom on the 36GB M5 Max. The 4B (~2.5GB weights) carries the
# same 256K context for a fraction of the footprint — full-MCP sessions
# (~50K harness prompt + curated MCP tool schemas + conversation headroom) fit
# comfortably with room to spare.
# Build: ollama create qwen3.5:4b-256k -f modelfiles/qwen3.5-4b-256k.Modelfile
FROM qwen3.5:4b
PARAMETER num_ctx 262144
